      "key": "quickFacts",
      "source": "planetcatfish",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.planetcatfish.com/common/species.php?species_id=1469",
      "html": "<p>Peckoltia capitulata Fisch-Muller &amp; Covain, 2012. Type locality: Approuague River, rapids of Saut Athanase, French Guiana. IUCN Red List: Critically Endangered (last assessed 2021).</p>"
    },
    {
      "key": "distribution",
      "source": "planetcatfish",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.planetcatfish.com/common/species.php?species_id=1469",
      "html": "<p>South America: coastal rivers of the Guianas, French Guiana, Approuague.</p>"
    },
    {
      "key": "aquariumSize",
      "source": "planetcatfish",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.planetcatfish.com/common/species.php?species_id=1469",
      "html": "<p>Size: 76 mm (3 inches) SL.</p>"
    },
    {
      "key": "equipment",
      "source": "planetcatfish",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.planetcatfish.com/common/species.php?species_id=1469",
      "html": "<p>Rock piles and wood tangles. Plants are not vital.</p>"
    },
    {
      "key": "behaviour",
      "source": "planetcatfish",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.planetcatfish.com/common/species.php?species_id=1469",
      "html": "<p>A medium sized pleco that can be combined with a very wide array of tankmates due to its unfussy nature. Perfectly safe with small fishes and shrimp or robust enough to withstand the attention of all but the largest cichlids.</p>"
    },
    {
      "key": "dimorphism",
      "source": "planetcatfish",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.planetcatfish.com/common/species.php?species_id=1469",
      "html": "<p>Males develop small teeth-like odontodes which adorn the leading pectoral fin rays and the back half of the body. Females remain unadorned and have a wider girth across the body, most evident when the area just behind the pectoral fins is viewed from above.</p>"
    },
    {
      "key": "reproduction",
      "source": "planetcatfish",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.planetcatfish.com/common/species.php?species_id=1469",
      "html": "<p>Cave spawner. There is no breeding report.</p>"
    },
    {
      "key": "references",
